Production
Design a container image for a Java application requiring only a subset of the JDK modules.
When would you deliberately ship a full JDK instead of a minimal runtime?
What should CI use versus what production needs?
Trap
Trap: "JRE is a completely separate thing from the JDK in all modern Java versions."
Be able to explain the historical model versus modern distribution model.
