Output Prediction
Given:
class A {
    static {
        System.out.println("A static");
    }
}

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println("main");
        new A();
    }
}
Predict the output.
At what point does A initialize?
Does loading A necessarily mean its static initializer immediately executes?
Production
